{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "2_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison is interested to see what happens with Albania",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "3_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: I'm interested to see is what happens with Albania",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "5_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: I'm interested to see is what happens with Albania",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "7_168261834222054982",
   "text": "we're now repatriating Albanians",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "8_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: we're now repatriating Albanians",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "10_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: we're now repatriating Albanians",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "12_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "15_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Albanians have no basis to be in the UK",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "16_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: they have no basis to be in this country",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "18_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: they have no basis to be in this country",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "20_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "28_168261834222054982",
   "text": "we hope to see a falloff in people making that hazardous journey from Albania, a safe country, to the UK",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "29_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison:  we see, as we anticipate, a falloff in people making that hazardous journey from Albania, a safe country, to the UK",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "31_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison:  we see, as we anticipate, a falloff in people making that hazardous journey from Albania, a safe country, to the UK",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "33_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "39_168261834222054982",
   "text": "we anticipate a falloff in people making that hazardous journey from Albania, a safe country, to the UK",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "40_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison:  as we anticipate",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "42_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison:  as we anticipate",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "44_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "47_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "50_168261834222054982",
   "text": "seeing a falloff in people making that hazardous journey from Albania, a safe country, to the UK will be an indicator of success",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "51_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: that will be an indicator of success",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "53_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: that will be an indicator of success",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "55_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "58_168261834222054982",
   "text": "the solution to the issue of people coming to the UK by boat isn't one-off",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "59_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: the solution to this isn't one-off",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "61_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: the solution to this isn't one-off",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "63_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "64_168261834222054982",
   "text": "the solution to the issue of people coming to the UK by boat is multi-factorial",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "65_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: it's multi-factorial",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "67_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: it's multi-factorial",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "69_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "72_168261834222054982",
   "text": "the things we've heard described this evening are all part of a solution to the issue of people coming to the UK by boat",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "73_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: the things we've heard describe this evening are all part of a solution",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "75_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: the things we've heard describe this evening are all part of a solution",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "77_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "78_168261834222054982",
   "text": "solving the issue of people coming to the UK by boat is going to be a long and complex",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "79_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: it's going to be long and complex",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "81_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: it's going to be long and complex",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "83_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "86_168261834222054982",
   "text": "at the end of the day the solution to the issue of people coming to the UK by boats will be incomplete",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "87_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: at the end of the day it will be incomplete",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "89_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: at the end of the day it will be incomplete",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "91_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "95_168261834222054982",
   "text": "there will always be people who make that hazardous journey",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "96_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: They will always be people who make that hazardous journey",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "98_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: They will always be people who make that hazardous journey",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "103_168261834222054982",
   "text": "what we have to do is to drive the number of people coming to the UK by boat down to a minimum",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "104_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: What we have to do is to drive that down to a minimum",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "106_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: What we have to do is to drive that down to a minimum",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "108_168261834222054982",
   "text": "we need to make sure genuine asylum seekers seek safe and legal routes to claim asylum in this country where they have always been welcomed",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "109_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Andrew Murrison: make sure genuine asylum seekers seek safe and legal routes to claim asylum in this country where they have always been welcomed",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "111_168261834222054982",
   "text": "Anon: Andrew Murrison: make sure genuine asylum seekers seek safe and legal routes to claim asylum in this country where they have always been welcomed",
   "type": "L"
  },
